# Context economy (this game)

Most work here is visual. Do not pay a full Agent tax on every pixel tweak.

## Do not

- Open the browser, screenshot, or CDP-loop unless the user asked to verify, or the change is otherwise uncheckable.
- Launch Task / subagents / parallel agents unless the user asked, or the work is 3+ disconnected areas.
- Generate images unless the user explicitly asked for a picture or asset.
- Read rasters under `public/assets/**`, whole folders, or 40KB+ files “to be thorough”.
- Re-read files already in this turn, or dump `git status` of untracked PNG/terrain.

## Do

- Touch the smallest file set (`src/ui/…` for chrome, `src/game/…` for rules).
- “Move N px / color / copy” → edit the known file; skip explore and browser.
- Prefer Grep or Read on a named path over a repo-wide explore agent.
- If you must verify in the browser: one pass, then stop.
